{"sourceUrl":"https://scs.nenu.edu.cn/info/1122/3743.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:51.397003+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://scs.nenu.edu.cn/info/1122/3743.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span></span></p><p><span><span>东北师范大学国际汉学院以培养优秀国际中文教师为使命，长期以来为国家和社会培养了大量具备国际视野、专业知识扎实、富有家国情怀的优秀人才。为促进全国各高校大学生之间的学术交流，选拔优秀大学生来我院学习深造，学院定于</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>27</span></span><span><span>至</span></span><span><span>28</span></span><span><span>日举办</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年度汉语国际教育硕士学术夏令营。</span> </span></p><p><strong><span><span>一、夏令营基本信息</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>1.招生学科</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>不限</span></span><span><span>专业。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>2.营员名额</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>0人</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>3.活动内容</span></span></strong></p><div><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span><span>日期</span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span><span>时间</span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span><span>内容</span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>27</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>13：30-17：00</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>营员报到</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>18：00-19：00</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>开营仪式</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>28</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>08：00-11：30</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>主题讲座</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>13：30-15：30</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>分组交流</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>16：00-17：00</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>闭营仪式</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><span>注：以上安排供参考，以实际为准。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>二、申请条件</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>1.</span></span></strong><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务，品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康；诚实守信，学风端正，未受过任何处分。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>2.</span></span></strong><span><span>申请者应为全国高等院校</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>级优秀本科在校生（即</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年应届本科毕业生）。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>3.</span></span></strong><span><span>学习成绩优秀，达到所在学校推荐免试生要求且有意申请我校推荐免试硕士或报考我院</span></span><span><span>国际中文教育</span></span><span><span>专业的学生。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>4.</span></span></strong><span><span>外语水平良好并至少达到全国大学英语四级及以上的水平，且具备一定的科研潜力。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>三、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>申请程序</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>1.报名时间</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>28</span></span><span><span>日至</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6月18</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>2.申请材料</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）身份证和学生证。</span></span><span><span>在</span></span><span><span>系统中的</span><span>“其他材料”模块处上传。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）成绩单</span></span><span><span>：本科前</span><span>5个学期成绩单和成绩排名证明（须教务处或院系盖章）。</span></span> </p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>）其他证明材料：如外语水平证书、各类获奖证书、取得的学术成果证明等。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>3.报名方式</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>5月28日8时至6月18日8时前，考生登录东北师范大学研究生招生服务系统“夏令营（预推免）登录”模块（网址：https://yz.nenu.edu.cn/ybm，先注册再登录），完成注册、填报信息和上传材料。申请人须在规定时间内完成网报，逾期不再受理。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>四、资格审核</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>学院夏令营工作小组将组织专家审核申请人提交的材料，择优确定夏令营营员名单，在学期间从事科研活动或在其中表现突出者优先。经审核通过的夏令营营员名单将在东北师范大学国际汉学院官网公布，并通过报名时的个人联系方式通知本人，被录取的营员应在电话中确认是否参加。未被接收为营员者，不另行通知。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>五、优秀营员选拔</span></span></strong></p><p><span>根据营员综合素质和表现，学院将评选优秀营员。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>六、其他说明</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>1.夏令营期间，东北师范大学国际汉学院将为营员提供免费食宿并购买人身意外保险，营员的交通费用自理。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.本次夏令营活动中与研究生招生相关事宜，最终以教育部和东北师范大学当年最新研究生招生政策为准。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>七、联系人</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>李</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span><span> <span>办公电话：</span><span>0431-85098276  邮箱：lism742@nenu.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span></span><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"6ab82329b4d22f4de28f47bcc4d3f4e19463d186f26f6482f2428190516a793e","textLength":1074,"sourceSha256":"b21fdeb5b1804aaca118d13bc8e5a7e2b04384d11371e7d5d9be66def8319df5","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ba6e97ca35687d404d49","title":"2025年东北师范大学国际汉学院2025年度全国优秀大学生夏令营的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:51.397003+00:00"}
